  "customHelp": "This Magic: the Gathering variant is designed for two players who both play out of the same 80 card deck. The two players share a library and a graveyard placed between them so that both players can reach them with ease. A card that refers to the “owner” of a library or graveyard or refers to “your library” or “your graveyard” refers to the singular library or graveyard. The “owner” of a card is the person who played that card from his or her hand.",
